g.uk/2024/screening-of-remembrance-1982-plus-qa-with-hugh-stoddart/\" title=\"Screening of Remembrance (1982) plus Q&#038;A with Hugh Stoddart\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"84\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-150x84.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-150x84.png 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-300x169.png 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-488x274.png 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-768x432.png 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1-90x51.png 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Remembrance-1982-1.png 859w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-remembrance-1982-plus-qa-with-hugh-stoddart/\"></div>A rare opportunity to see this re-discovered British film from 1982 on the big screen, which was Gary Oldman’s first film, and also starred Tim Spall and John Altman.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-remembrance-1982-plus-qa-with-hugh-stoddart/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-remembrance-1982-plus-qa-with-hugh-stoddart/#more-34200\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-33945\" class=\"post-33945 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/the-legend-of-houdini/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on The Legend of Houdini\">The Legend of Houdini</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 22 Mar 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on The Legend of Houdini</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/the-legend-of-houdini/\" title=\"The Legend of Houdini\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini-150x150.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini-300x300.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini-488x488.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini-90x90.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/The-Legend-of-Houdini.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/the-legend-of-houdini/\"></div>Magician and escape artist Greg Chapman performs effects and escapes inspired by Houdini, and shares some of the stories that make up ‘The Legend of Houdini’!<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/the-legend-of-houdini/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/the-legend-of-houdini/#more-33945\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-35070\" class=\"post-35070 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/screening-of-satu-year-of-the-rabbit-2024-with-intro-and-qa/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Screening of <em>Satu &#8211; Year of the Rabbit</em> (2024) with intro and Q&#038;A\">Screening of <em>Satu &#8211; Year of the Rabbit</em> (2024) with intro and Q&#038;A</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Wed 26 Mar 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &m