ction-poster-101x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-French-Connection-poster-101x150.jpg 101w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-French-Connection-poster-61x90.jpg 61w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/The-French-Connection-poster.jpg 190w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 101px) 100vw, 101px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-nickel-presents-the-french-connection-1971-on-16mm/\"></div>In tribute to the late great Gene Hackman, The Nickel presents a screening of The French Connection on 16mm film, paired with an intro by Dominic Hicks.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-nickel-presents-the-french-connection-1971-on-16mm/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-nickel-presents-the-french-connection-1971-on-16mm/#more-35152\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34974\" class=\"post-34974 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/8th-kennington-bioscope-silent-film-weekend/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on 8th Kennington Bioscope Silent Film Weekend\">8th Kennington Bioscope Silent Film Weekend</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 5 Apr  - Sun 6 Apr 2025 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on 8th Kennington Bioscope Silent Film Weekend</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/8th-kennington-bioscope-silent-film-weekend/\" title=\"8th Kennington Bioscope Silent Film Weekend\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"60\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster-60x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster-60x150.jpg 60w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster-120x300.jpg 120w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster-196x488.jpg 196w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster-36x90.jpg 36w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The_Ring_1927_movie_poster.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 60px) 100vw, 60px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/8th-kennington-bioscope-silent-film-weekend/\"></div>Our Silent Film Weekend will take place over the 5-6 April. There is the customary blend of archive treasures and mainstream entertainment, presented by an enthusiastic team of experts with, of course, the usual live music from our skilled accompanists.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/8th-kennington-bioscope-silent-film-weekend/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/8th-kennington-bioscope-silent-film-weekend/#more-34974\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34678\" class=\"post-34678 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-vindication-swim-2024-plus-qa-with-director-elliott-hasler/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Screening of <em>Vindication Swim</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with director Elliott Hasler\">Screening of <em>Vindication Swim</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with director Elliott Hasler</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Thu 10 Apr 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Screening of <em>Vindication Swim</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with director Elliott Hasler</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-vindication-swim-2024-plus-qa-with-director-elliott-hasler/\" title=\"Screening of Vindication Swim (2024) plus Q&#038;A with director Elliott Hasler\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"135\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster-135x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster-135x150.jpg 135w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster-270x300.jpg 270w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster-440x488.jpg 440w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster-81x90.jpg 81w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Vindication_Swim_Poster.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-vindication-swim-2024-plus-qa-with-director-elliott-hasler/\"></div>The Cinema Museum presents a screening of the award winning 2024 British film Vindication Swim, the true story of a remarkable British woman, Mercedes Gleitze, who in 1927 became the first British woman to swim the English Channel.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-vindication-swim-2024-plus-qa-with-director-elliott-hasler/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/screening-of-vindication-swim-2024-plus-qa-with-director-elliott-hasler/#more-34678\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34700\" class=\"post-34700 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-never-let-go-1960/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Never Let Go</em> (1960)\">Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Never Let Go</em> (1960)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 12 Apr 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Never Let Go</em> (1960)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-never-let-go-1960/\" title=\"Celebrating Peter Sellers: Never Let Go (1960)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"100\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Never-Let-Go-poster-100x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\