</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34817\" class=\"post-34817 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/fundraiser-screening-of-kensukes-kingdom-2024-plus-qa-with-directors-kirk-hendry-and-neil-boyle/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Fundraiser screening of <em>Kensuke’s Kingdom</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with directors Kirk Hendry and Neil Boyle\">Fundraiser screening of <em>Kensuke’s Kingdom</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with directors Kirk Hendry and Neil Boyle</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sun 13 Apr 2025 @ 14:00 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Fundraiser screening of <em>Kensuke’s Kingdom</em> (2024) plus Q&#038;A with directors Kirk Hendry and Neil Boyle</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/fundraiser-screening-of-kensukes-kingdom-2024-plus-qa-with-directors-kirk-hendry-and-neil-boyle/\" title=\"Fundraiser screening of Kensuke’s Kingdom (2024) plus Q&#038;A with directors Kirk Hendry and Neil Boyle\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"102\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kensukes-Kingdom-poster-2-102x150.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kensukes-Kingdom-poster-2-102x150.png 102w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kensukes-Kingdom-poster-2-203x300.png 203w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kensukes-Kingdom-poster-2-61x90.png 61w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Kensukes-Kingdom-poster-2.png 277w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 102px) 100vw, 102px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/fundraiser-screening-of-kensukes-kingdom-2024-plus-qa-with-directors-kirk-hendry-and-neil-boyle/\"></div>Kensuke’s Kingdom (2024) is the multi award-winning animated film based on the best selling novel by Michael Morpurgo, with a screenplay by Frank Cottrell-Boyce, and featuring the voices of Cillian Murphy, Sally Hawkins and Ken Watanabe.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/fundraiser-screening-of-kensukes-kingdom-2024-plus-qa-with-directors-kirk-hendry-and-neil-boyle/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/fundraiser-screening-of-kensukes-kingdom-2024-plus-qa-with-directors-kirk-hendry-and-neil-boyle/#more-34817\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34767\" class=\"post-34767 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/kennington-noir-presents-act-of-violence-1948/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Kennington Noir presents <em>Act of Violence</em> (1948)\">Kennington Noir presents <em>Act of Violence</em> (1948)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Wed 16 Apr 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Kennington Noir presents <em>Act of Violence</em> (1948)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/kennington-noir-presents-act-of-violence-1948/\" title=\"Kennington Noir presents Act of Violence (1948)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"103\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-103x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-103x150.jpg 103w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-206x300.jpg 206w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-335x488.jpg 335w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-768x1117.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster-62x90.jpg 62w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Act-of-Violence-poster.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 103px) 100vw, 103px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/kennington-noir-presents-act-of-violence-1948/\"></div>Fred Zinnemann directs this 1948 noir that shines a light on the aftermath of WWII on soldiers returning to civilian life, with Van Helfin the target of Robert Ryan's need to right a supposed wartime wrong.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/kennington-noir-presents-act-of-violence-1948/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/kennington-noir-presents-act-of-violence-1948/#more-34767\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34850\" class=\"post-34850 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-code-two-1953/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Code Two</em> (1953)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>Code Two</em> (1953)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 19 Apr 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Code Two</em> (1953)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\