hanghai Express</em> (1932)\">Women and Cocaine presents <em>Shanghai Express</em> (1932)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Fri 23 May 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Women and Cocaine presents <em>Shanghai Express</em> (1932)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-shanghai-express-1932/\" title=\"Women and Cocaine presents Shanghai Express (1932)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"100\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster-100x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster-100x150.jpg 100w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster-200x300.jpg 200w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster-325x488.jpg 325w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster-60x90.jpg 60w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Shanghai-Express-poster.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-shanghai-express-1932/\"></div>Marlene Dietrich, Clive Brook  and Anna May Wong star in Josef von Sternberg's tale of intrigue and romance aboard a train bound for Shanghai<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings b