"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton-120x150.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton-120x150.png 120w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton-240x300.png 240w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton-390x488.png 390w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton-72x90.png 72w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/George-Layton.png 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 120px) 100vw, 120px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-george-layton-tells-fibs-and-stories/\"></div>Mist Moon presents an evening with actor and writer George Layton, who will talk about balancing a successful acting career with a full time writing career, and will read some of his stories evoking memories of the 1950s.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-george-layton-tells-fibs-and-stories/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-george-layton-tells-fibs-and-stories/#more-33715\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t