ass=\"sf-drop-indicator\"><a style=\"cursor:default;\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">About</a><ul><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/about/history/\" >History</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/visit/\" >Visit Us</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/about/links/\" >Links</a></li></ul></li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"sf-blue-after\"></div>\r\n<!-- WP Menubar 5.9.3: end menu main_nav, template Suckerfish_41, CSS sf-blue.css -->\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                    @media screen and (-ms-high-contrast: active), (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\n                        /* Like IE9, which support conditional comments, IE10 needs less padding than the IE8 default */\n                        .sf-blue a, .sf-blue a:hover, .sf-blue a:visited { padding: 0 10.8px; }\n                    }\n                </style>\n\t\t<!--[if IE 9]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie9.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\n\t</div>\t\t\r\n\t<div id=\"content_box\">\r\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"posts\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<h1 id=\"content_header\">Upcoming Events</h1>\r\n\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34740\" class=\"post-34740 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-dr-strangelove-or-how-i-learned-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-bomb-1964/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb</em> (1964)\">Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb</em> (1964)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 7 Jun 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb</em> (1964)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-dr-strangelove-or-how-i-learned-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-bomb-1964/\" title=\"Celebrating Peter Sellers: Dr. Strangelove or: How I Learned to Stop Worrying and Love the Bomb (1964)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"97\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dr-Strangelove-poster-97x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dr-Strangelove-poster-97x150.jpg 97w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dr-Strangelove-poster-193x300.jpg 193w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dr-Strangelove-poster-58x90.jpg 58w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Dr-Strangelove-poster.jpg 250w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 97px) 100vw, 97px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-dr-strangelove-or-how-i-learned-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-bomb-1964/\"></div>Kubrick's satirical masterpiece about nuclear Armageddon has Sellers in three roles, showing his acting and comedy skills at their finest.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-dr-strangelove-or-how-i-learned-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-bomb-1964/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-dr-strangelove-or-how-i-learned-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-bomb-1964/#more-34740\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34887\" class=\"post-34887 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-danger-diabolik-1968/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Danger: Diabolik</em> (1968)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>Danger: Diabolik</em> (1968)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 14 Jun 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Danger: Diabolik</em> (1968)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-danger-diabolik-1968/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents Danger: Diabolik (1968)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"99\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster-99x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster-99x150.jpg 99w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster-198x300.jpg 198w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster-322x488.jpg 322w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster-59x90.jpg 59w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Diabolik-poster.jpg 394w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 99px) 100vw, 99px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-danger-diabolik-1968/\"></div>Based on an Italian comic book series, Mario Bava's film stars John Phillip Law and Marisa Mell as a master thief and his lover who pull off multiple heists, one step ahead of the police and rival gangsters.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-danger-diabolik-1968/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p