ss/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/A-Shot-in-the-Dark-poster-106x150.jpeg 106w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/A-Shot-in-the-Dark-poster-213x300.jpeg 213w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/A-Shot-in-the-Dark-poster-64x90.jpeg 64w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/A-Shot-in-the-Dark-poster.jpeg 270w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 106px) 100vw, 106px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-a-shot-in-the-dark-1964/\"></div>Peter Sellers plays Inspector Jacques Clouseau, who is sent to the country home of millionaire Benjamin Ballon to investigate the shooting of his chauffeur, Miguel.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-a-shot-in-the-dark-1964/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-a-shot-in-the-dark-1964/#more-34747\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34895\" class=\"post-34895 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Engaged to Death</em> (1957)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>Engaged to Death</em> (1957)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 19 Jul 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Engaged to Death</em> (1957)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents Engaged to Death (1957)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"106\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster-106x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster-106x150.jpg 106w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster-213x300.jpg 213w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster-346x488.jpg 346w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster-64x90.jpg 64w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-poster.jpg 425w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 106px) 100vw, 106px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\"></div>A tale of love, rivalry and passion set in the 50s world of motorcycle speed races, shot at main competitions, such as Monza's GP and the last Milano-Taranto race.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/#more-34895\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34755\" class=\"post-34755 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-being-there-1979/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Being There</em> (1979)\">Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Being There</em> (1979)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 13 Sep 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Being There</em> (1979)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-being-there-1979/\" title=\"Celebrating Peter Sellers: Being There (1979)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"97\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-97x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-97x150.jpg 97w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-193x300.jpg 193w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-314x488.jpg 314w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-768x1193.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-989x1536.jpg 989w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster-58x90.jpg 58w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Being-There-poster.jpg 1113w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 97px) 100vw, 97px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-being-there-1979/\"></div>In Hal Ashby's film, Sellers plays a simple-minded gardener who by accident becomes an unofficial advisor to the powerful in Washington.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-being-there-1979/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-being-there-1979/#more-34755\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34902\" class=\"post-34902 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Cramps and The Mutants: The Napa State Tapes</em> (1978)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Cramps and The Mutants: The Napa State Tapes</em> (1978)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 20 Sep 2025 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Cramps and The Mutants: The Napa State Tapes</em> (1978)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents The Cramps and The Mutants: The Napa State Tapes (1978)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"120\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster-120x150.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster-120x150.png 120w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster-240x300.png 240w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster-390x488.png 390w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster-72x90.png 72w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/We-Were-There-to-Be-There-2021-poster.png 408w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 120px) 100vw, 120px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/\"></div>On June 13, 1978, the Target Video collective filmed a performance by The Cramps and The Mutants at Napa State Hospital to an audience of around 100 mental patients. Their recording of the show became an underground sensation.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/#more-34902\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\nRC: replace standard pagination with WP Paginate plugin function.\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<div class=\"previous\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6/\" >&larr; Previous Entries</a></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/4/\" >Next Entries &rarr;</a></div>\r\n</div>\t\r\n-->\r\n<div class=\"pagination\"><ol class=\"wp-paginate font-tahoma\"><li><span class=\"title\">Pages:</span></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/4\" class=\"prev\" aria-label=\"Go to previous page\">&laquo;</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/' title='1' aria-label='Go to page 1' class='page'>1</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/2/' title='2' aria-label='Go to page 2' class='page'>2</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/3/' title='3' aria-label='Go to page 3' class='page'>3</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/4/' title='4' aria-label='Go to page 4' class='page'>4</a></li><li><span class='page current'>5</span></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6/' title='6' aria-label='Go to page 6' class='page'>6</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/7/' title='7' aria-label='Go to page 7' class='page'>7</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6\" class=\"next\" aria-label=\"Go to next page\">&raquo;</a></li></ol></div><div class=\"clear flat\"></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"sidebar\">\r\n\t<ul class=\"sidebar_list\">\r\n\t\t<li id=\"search-3\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Search</h2>\n<form method=\"get\" id=\"search_form\" action=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">\r\n\t<input type=\"text\" class=\"search_input\" value=\"To search, type and hit enter\" name=\"s\" id=\"s\" onfocus=\"if (this.value == 'To search, type and hit enter') {this.value = '';}\" onblur=\"if (this.value == '') {this.value = 'To search, type and hit enter';}\" />\r\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"searchsubmit\" value=\"Search\" />\r\n</form>\r\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom_html-5\" class=\"widget_text widget widget_custom_html\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Buy Advance Tickets From Ticketlab</h2>\n<div class=\"textwidget custom-html-widget\"><p class=\"final\"><a href=\"https://ticketlab.co.uk/events/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img style=\"border:1px solid teal; height:200px\" \r\nsrc=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/ticketlab.png\" ></a></p></div></li>\n<li id=\"text-7\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Contact Us</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p class=\"final\">The Cinema Museum<br /> \n2 Dugard Way (off Renfrew Road)<br />\nLondon SE11 4TH UK<br />\nTel.: 0207 840 2200<br />\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a></p></div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"text-6\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Get Twitter updates</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>You can check back here for the latest updates on our event programme - but why not let the Cinema Museum tweet you?</p>\n<p>Start following @CinemaMuseum by visiting our <a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Twitter page</a>, or by texting follow CinemaMuseum to 86444 (in the UK).</p>\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"final\"><a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter logo\" title=\"Follow us on Twitter\"/></a></p> </div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget-1\" class=\"widget widget_addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget\"><!-- Widget added by an AddThis plugin --><!-- widget name: AddThis Tool --><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Share this Page</h2>\n<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style \"><a class=\"addthis_button_facebook_like\" fb:like:layout=\"button_count\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_tweet\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_pinterest_pinit\"></a><a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_pill_style\"></a></div><!-- End of widget --></li>\n\t</ul>\r\n</div>\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n<div id=\"footer\">\n\t<div id=\"contact\">\n\t\t<p>The Cinema Museum\n\t\t\t<br />2 Dugard Way, London SE11 4TH\n\t\t\t<br />Tel.: +44 (0)20 7840 2200\n\t\t\t<br />Email:\n\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a>\n\t\t</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"copyright\">\n\t\t<p>&copy;\n\t\t\tThe Cinema Museum, London &mdash; Site by Antbird</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"social_links\">\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/pages/London/The-Cinema-Museum/94435861815\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/facebook.jpg\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/twitter.png\" alt=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\" title=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<!-- Removed obsolete items ... PC 2/2/18\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/youtube-logo.gif\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\"\n\t\t\t/>