_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-the-divorcee-1930/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-the-divorcee-1930/#more-34931\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-33492\" class=\"post-33492 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-the-bill-reunion-14/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Misty Moon Presents <em>The Bill</em> Reunion 14\">Misty Moon Presents <em>The Bill</em> Reunion 14</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 18 Oct 2025 @ 17:00 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Misty Moon Presents <em>The Bill</em> Reunion 14</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-the-bill-reunion-14/\" title=\"Misty Moon Presents The Bill Reunion 14\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"105\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/The-Bill-logo-150x105.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/The-Bill-logo-150x105.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/The-Bill-logo-300x211.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/The-Bill-logo-90x63.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/The-Bill-logo.jpg 375w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-the-bill-reunion-14/\"></div>Misty Moon is back with Sun Hill’s finest.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-the-bill-reunion-14/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/misty-moon-presents-the-bill-reunion-14/#more-33492\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34936\" class=\"post-34936 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-platinum-blonde-1931/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Women and Cocaine presents <em>Platinum Blonde</em> (1931)\">Women and Cocaine presents <em>Platinum Blonde</em> (1931)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Thu 23 Oct 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Women and Cocaine presents <em>Platinum Blonde</em> (1931)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-platinum-blonde-1931/\" title=\"Women and Cocaine presents Platinum Blonde (1931)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"116\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-116x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-116x150.jpg 116w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-232x300.jpg 232w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-378x488.jpg 378w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-768x992.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster-70x90.jpg 70w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Platinum-Blonde-poster.jpg 774w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 116px) 100vw, 116px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-platinum-blonde-1931/\"></div>In Frank Capra's classic comedy stars Jean Harlow as a wealthy heiress who marries for a brash reporter, but they suffer a class-based clash.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter 