ing=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Home-Movie-Day-2-112x150.jpg 112w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Home-Movie-Day-2-224x300.jpg 224w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Home-Movie-Day-2-67x90.jpg 67w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/Home-Movie-Day-2.jpg 281w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 112px) 100vw, 112px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/home-movie-day-2025/\"></div>The annual event celebrating amateur film returns. Bring any film on 9.5 mm, super 8, 8 mm or 16 mm for a free examination by a professional film archivist followed by projection on the big screen.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/home-movie-day-2025/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/home-movie-day-2025/#more-34970\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34910\" class=\"post-34910 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-return-of-the-living-dead-1985/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Return of the Living Dead</em> (1985)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Return of the Living Dead</em> (1985)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 25 Oct 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Return of the Living Dead</em> (1985)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-return-of-the-living-dead-1985/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents The Return of the Living Dead (1985)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"99\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster-99x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster-99x150.jpg 99w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster-197x300.jpg 197w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster-320x488.jpg 320w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster-59x90.jpg 59w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Return-of-the-Living-Dead-poster.jpg 394w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 99px) 100vw, 99px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-return-of-the-living-dead-1985/\"></div>Horror and sci-fi screenplay maestro Dan O'Bannon directs this 1985 horror comedy. Two bumbling employees at a medical supply warehouse release a deadly gas into the air, which causes the dead to rise again as zombies.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-return-of-the-living-dead-1985/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-return-of-the-living-dead-1985/#more-34910\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-35083\" class=\"post-35083 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Misty Moon presents <em>Dracula: Dead and Loving It</em> (1995) + Q&#038;A with Lysette Anthony\">Misty Moon presents <em>Dracula: Dead and Loving It</em> (1995) + Q&#038;A with Lysette Anthony</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sun 26 Oct 2025 @ 14:00 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Misty Moon presents <em>Dracula: Dead and Loving It</em> (1995) + Q&#038;A with Lysette Anthony</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\" title=\"Misty Moon presents Dracula: Dead and Loving It (1995) + Q&#038;A with Lysette Anthony\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"83\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-poster-83x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-poster-83x150.jpg 83w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-poster-165x300.jpg 165w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-poster-50x90.jpg 50w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-poster.jpg 262w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 83px) 100vw, 83px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\"></div>Misty Moon presents Mel Brooks&#8217;s horror spoof, starring the great Leslie Nielsen as the Count and Brooks himself as Van Helsing. The screening is followed by a Q&amp;A with star Lysette Anthony, who plays Lucy Westenra (and other guests to be announced).<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/#more-35083\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-35016\" class=\"post-35016 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/richard-burton-at-100-a-celebration/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Richard Burton at 100 – A Celebration\">Richard Burton at 100 – A Celebration</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Mon 10 Nov 2025 @ 19:00 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Richard Burton at 100 – A Celebration</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/richard-burton-at-100-a-celebration/\" title=\"Richard Burton at 100 – A Celebration\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"150\" height=\"146\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Where-Eagles-Dare-150x146.webp\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Where-Eagles-Dare-150x146.webp 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Where-Eagles-Dare-300x293.webp 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Where-Eagles-Dare-90x88.webp 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Where-Eagles-Dare.webp 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/richard-burton-at-100-a-celebration/\"></div>Join us for an evening of celebration to mark the centenary of Richard Burton, one of the twentieth century’s most charismatic and powerful actors.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/richard-burton-at-100-a-celebration/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/richard-burton-at-100-a-celebration/#more-35016\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34919\" class=\"post-34919 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-mystery-train-1989-2/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Mystery Train</em> (1989)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>Mystery Train</em> (1989)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 15 Nov 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>Mystery Train</em> (1989)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-mystery-train-1989-2/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents Mystery Train (1989)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"115\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster-115x150.png\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster-115x150.png 115w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster-231x300.png 231w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster-375x488.png 375w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster-69x90.png 69w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Mystery-Train-1989-poster.png 486w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 115px) 100vw, 115px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-mystery-train-1989-2/\"></div>Jim Jarmusch's film triptych centres on a seedy Memphis hotel, and tells the stories of a Japanese couple of an Elvis pilgrimage, an Italian widow stuck in the city, and an Englishman and his two companions hiding after a botched liquor store holdup.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-mystery-train-1989-2/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-mystery-train-1989-2/#more-34919\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\nRC: replace standard pagination with WP Paginate plugin function.\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<div class=\"previous\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/7/\" >&larr; Previous Entries</a></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/5/\" >Next Entries &rarr;</a></div>\r\n</div>\t\r\n-->\r\n<div class=\"pagination\"><ol class=\"wp-paginate font-tahoma\"><li><span class=\"title\">Pages:</span></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/5\" class=\"prev\" aria-label=\"Go to previous page\">&laquo;</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/' title='1' aria-label='Go to page 1' class='page'>1</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/2/' title='2' aria-label='Go to page 2' class='page'>2</a></