bove via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-safe-in-hell-1931/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-safe-in-hell-1931/#more-34943\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34950\" class=\"post-34950 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-42nd-street-1933/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Women and Cocaine presents <em>42nd Street</em> (1933)\">Women and Cocaine presents <em>42nd Street</em> (1933)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Thu 11 Dec 2025 @ 19:30 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Women and Cocaine presents <em>42nd Street</em> (1933)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-42nd-street-1933/\" title=\"Women and Cocaine presents 42nd Street (1933)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"100\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/42nd-Street-poster-100x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/42nd-Street-poster-100x150.jpg 100w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/42nd-Street-poster-200x300.jpg 200w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/42nd-Street-poster-60x90.jpg 60w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/42nd-Street-poster.jpg 220w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 100px) 100vw, 100px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-42nd-street-1933/\"></div><em>42nd Street</em> is a dazzling backstage musical that follows director Julian Marsh as he mounts a Broadway show during the Great Depression, featuring choreography by the great Busby Berkeley.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-42nd-street-1933/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/women-and-cocaine-presents-42nd-street-1933/#more-34950\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34924\" class=\"post-34924 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-final-programme-1973/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"Article on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Final Programme</em> (1973)\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Final Programme</em> (1973)</a></h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 20 Dec 2025 <!-- by David --> &middot; <!--<span>Comments Off<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> on Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Final Programme</em> (1973)</span></span> &middot;--><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a><!-- --></h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-final-programme-1973/\" title=\"Some new kind of kick presents The Final Programme (1973)\" >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"107\" height=\"150\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster-107x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster-107x150.jpg 107w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster-213x300.jpg 213w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster-347x488.jpg 347w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster-64x90.jpg 64w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/The-Final-Programme-poster.jpg 395w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 107px) 100vw, 107px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-final-programme-1973/\"></div>Jon Finch and Jenny Runacre star in this version of Michael Moorcock's first Jerry Cornelius novel. A trio of scientists plan to create a self-replicating, immortal, hermaphrodite.<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on get_the_excerpt --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on get_the_excerpt --><div class=\"at-below-post-cat-page addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-final-programme-1973/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on get_the_excerpt -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"forwardLink\">[<a class=\"forwardLink\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-final-programme-1973/#more-34924\">Read more &rarr;</a>]</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_footer\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\nRC: replace standard pagination with WP Paginate plugin function.\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<div class=\"previous\"></div>\r\n\t<div class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6/\" >Next Entries &rarr;</a></div>\r\n</div>\t\r\n-->\r\n<div class=\"pagination\"><ol class=\"wp-paginate font-tahoma\"><li><span class=\"title\">Pages:</span></li><li><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6\" class=\"prev\" aria-label=\"Go to previous page\">&laquo;</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/' title='1' aria-label='Go to page 1' class='page'>1</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/2/' title='2' aria-label='Go to page 2' class='page'>2</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/3/' title='3' aria-label='Go to page 3' class='page'>3</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/4/' title='4' aria-label='Go to page 4' class='page'>4</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/5/' title='5' aria-label='Go to page 5' class='page'>5</a></li><li><a href='http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/page/6/' title='6' aria-label='Go to page 6' class='page'>6</a></li><li><span class='page current'>7</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"clear flat\"></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"sidebar\">\r\n\t<ul class=\"sidebar_list\">\r\n\t\t<li id=\"search-3\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Search</h2>\n<form method=\"get\" id=\"search_form\" action=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">\r\n\t<input type=\"text\" class=\"search_input\" value=\"To search, type and hit enter\" name=\"s\" id=\"s\" onfocus=\"if (this.value == 'To search, type and hit enter') {this.value = '';}\" onblur=\"if (this.value == '') {this.value = 'To search, type and hit enter';}\" />\r\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"searchsubmit\" value=\"Search\" />\r\n</form>\r\n</li>\n<li id=\"custom_html-5\" class=\"widget_text widget widget_custom_html\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Buy Advance Tickets From Ticketlab</h2>\n<div class=\"textwidget custom-html-widget\"><p class=\"final\"><a href=\"https://ticketlab.co.uk/events/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img style=\"border:1px solid teal; height:200px\" \r\nsrc=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/ticketlab.png\" ></a></p></div></li>\n<li id=\"text-7\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Contact Us</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p class=\"final\">The Cinema Museum<br /> \n2 Dugard Way (off Renfrew Road)<br />\nLondon SE11 4TH UK<br />\nTel.: 0207 840 2200<br />\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a></p></div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"text-6\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Get Twitter updates</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>You can check back here for the latest updates on our event programme - but why not let the Cinema Museum tweet you?</p>\n<p>Start following @CinemaMuseum by visiting our <a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Twitter page</a>, or by texting follow CinemaMuseum to 86444 (in the UK).</p>\n<p align=\"right\" class=\"final\"><a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter logo\" title=\"Follow us on Twitter\"/></a></p> </div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget-1\" class=\"widget widget_addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget\"><!-- Widget added by an AddThis plugin --><!-- widget name: AddThis Tool --><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Share this Page</h2>\n<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style \"><a class=\"addthis_button_facebook_like\" fb:like:layout=\"button_count\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_tweet\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_pinterest_pinit\"></a><a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_pill_style\"></a></div><!-- End of widget --></li>\n\t</ul>\r\n</div>\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n<div id=\"footer\">\n\t<div id=\"contact\">\n\t\t<p>The Cinema Museum\n\t\t\t<br />2 Dugard Way, London SE11 4TH\n\t\t\t<br />Tel.: +44 (0)20 7840 2200\n\t\t\t<br />Email:\n\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a>\n\t\t</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"copyright\">\n\t\t<p>&copy;\n\t\t\tThe Cinema Museum, London &mdash; Site by Antbird</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"social_links\">\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/pages/London/The-Cinema-Museum/94435861815\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/facebook.jpg\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/twitter.png\" alt=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\" title=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<!-- Removed obsolete items ... PC 2/2/18\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/youtube-logo.gif\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a> \n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/feed/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Syndicate this site using RSS\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/rss.png\" alt=\"Subscribe to the Cinema Museum's RSS Feed\" title=\"Subscribe to the Cinema Museum's RSS Feed\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>-->\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"full_clear very_flat\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Powered by eShop v6.3.14 by Rich Pedley http://www.quirm.net/--><!-- Lightbox Plus v2.0.5 - 2010.07.02 - Message: 0-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\njQuery(document).ready(function($){\n  $(\"a[rel*=lightbox]\").colorbox({opacity:0.8});\n});\n</script>\n<script>\r\n  (function(i,s,o,g,r,a,m){i['GoogleAnalyticsObject']=r;i[r]=i[r]||function(){\r\n  (i[r].q=i[r].q||[]).push(arguments)},i[r].l=1*new Date();a=s.createElement(o),\r\n  m=s.getElementsByTagName(o)[0];a.async=1;a.src=g;m.parentNode.insertBefore(a,m)\r\n  })(window,document,'script','//www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js','ga');\r\n\r\n  ga('create', 'UA-41628024-1', 'cinemamuseum.org.uk');\r\n  ga('send', 'pageview');\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"text/javascrip