s\">\n                    @media screen and (-ms-high-contrast: active), (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\n                        /* Like IE9, which support conditional comments, IE10 needs less padding than the IE8 default */\n                        .sf-blue a, .sf-blue a:hover, .sf-blue a:visited { padding: 0 10.8px; }\n                    }\n                </style>\n\t\t<!--[if IE 9]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie9.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div id=\"content_box\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"posts\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<span class=\"previous\">&larr; <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/kennington-bioscope-presents-a-programme-of-antiquities/\" rel=\"prev\">Kennington Bioscope presents a programme of ‘antiquities’</a></span>\r\n\t<span class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-nickel-presents-eraserhead-1977-on-16mm/\" rel=\"next\">The Nickel presents <em>Eraserhead</em> (1977) on 16mm <span style=color:red>&#8211; SOLD OUT &#8211; SEE FEB 15th</span></a> &rarr;</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"clear whitespace\"></div>\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34996\" class=\"post-34996 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: Comment and Edit functionality removed from following post header. Date reduced to Month and Year. Conditional 'Featured Article' added\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The Live Ghost Tent – Quarterly meeting of The Laurel and Hardy Society 8th March 2025</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 8 Mar 2025 @ 15:00 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- by David --> &middot; \r\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-live-ghost-tent-quarterly-meeting-of-the-laurel-and-hardy-society-8th-march-2025/#comments\">No Comments</a> &middot; -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a>\t\t\t\t\t<!--  -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: I'm not clear when the_content pagination would be triggered.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tIf triggered, consider changing to plug-in based pagination.\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-live-ghost-tent-quarterly-meeting-of-the-laurel-and-hardy-society-8th-march-2025/\"></div><p><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Swiss Miss - click to enlarge\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-34998 size-large\" title=\"Swiss Miss - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss-488x385.jpg\" alt=\"Swiss Miss\" width=\"488\" height=\"385\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss-488x385.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss-300x237.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss-150x118.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss-90x71.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Swiss-Miss.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a>The Live Ghost Tent – quarterly meeting of The Laurel and Hardy Society. <span id=\"more-34996\"></span></p>\n<p>The films we intend to show are: <em>Putting Pants on Philip</em>; (1927), silent short directed by Clyde Bruckman; <em>Our Wife</em> (1931), short directed by James W. Horne; <em>The Fixer Uppers</em> (1935), short directed by Charley Rogers; <em>Brats</em> (1930), short directed by James Parrott; <em>Swiss Miss</em> (1937), directed by John G. Blystone and Hal Roach.</p>\n<p>The meeting runs from 3pm to 7pm.</p>\n<p>More details on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1101999479833042/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Facebook</a> page.</p>\n<h3>TICKETS &amp; PRICING</h3>\n<p>The membership fee is for one year and includes entrance to our meetings and a copy of our international quarterly magazine the Intra-Tent Journal.</p>\n<p>Single cost of membership is £10 per annum, £12.50 for a couple living at the same address.</p>\n<p>Non-members are welcome and we ask for a donation of £5 per meeting. Children under the age of 12, accompanied by an adult are admitted free.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Brats - click to enlarge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-32444 size-large\" title=\"Brats - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930-488x392.jpg\" alt=\"Brats\" width=\"488\" height=\"392\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930-488x392.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930-300x241.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930-150x120.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930-90x72.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Brats-1930.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a></p>\n<!-- PHP 5.x --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on the_content --><div class=\"at-below-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/the-live-ghost-tent-quarterly-meeting-of-the-laurel-and-hardy-society-8th-march-2025/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on the_content -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type='text/javascript'>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//<![CDATA[\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.write(\"<h4 class='backLink'>[<a href='javascript:history.back()' class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back<\\/a>]<\\/h4>\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//]]>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</script>\t\t\t\t\t<noscript><h4 class='backLink'>[<a href=\"\" class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back</a>]</h4></noscript>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tagged\"><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/tag/contact/\" rel=\"tag\">Contact</a></p>\t\t\t\tRC: Remove tag functionality and replace the 'clear' div with a flatter 'clear flat' one.\r\n-->\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear flat\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<!--\t\t\r\n\t\t\tRC: Comment functionality removed. (IE8 fails to see this as comment, so commented the php also.)\r\n\t\t\t-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"sidebar\">\r\n\t<ul class=\"sidebar_list\">\r\n\t\t<li id=\"search-3\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Search</h2>\n<form method=\"get\" id=\"search_form\" action=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">\r\n\t<input type=\"text\" class=\"search_input\" value=\"To search, type and hit enter\" name=\"s\" id=\"s\" onfocus=\"if (this.value == 'To search, type and hit enter') {this.value = '';}\" onblur=\"if (this.value == '') {this.value = 'To search, type and hit enter';}\" />\r\n\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"searchsubmit\" value=\"Search\" />\r\n</form>\r\n</li>\n<li id=\"text-7\" class=\"widget widget_text\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Contact Us</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p class=\"final\">The Cinema Museum<br /> \n2 Dugard Way (off Renfrew Road)<br />\nLondon SE11 4TH UK<br />\nTel.: 0207 840 2200<br />\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a></p></div>\n\t\t</li>\n<li id=\"addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget-1\" class=\"widget widget_addthis_tool_by_class_name_widget\"><!-- Widget added by an AddThis plugin --><!-- widget name: AddThis Tool --><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Share this Page</h2>\n<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style \"><a class=\"addthis_button_facebook_like\" fb:like:layout=\"button_count\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_tweet\"></a><a class=\"addthis_button_pinterest_pinit\"></a><a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_pill_style\"></a></div><!-- End of widget --></li>\n\t</ul>\r\n</div>\t\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"footer\">\n\t<div id=\"contact\">\n\t\t<p>The Cinema Museum\n\t\t\t<br />2 Dugard Way, London SE11 4TH\n\t\t\t<br />Tel.: +44 (0)20 7840 2200\n\t\t\t<br />Email:\n\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@cinemamuseum.org.uk\">info@cinemamuseum.org.uk</a>\n\t\t</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"copyright\">\n\t\t<p>&copy;\n\t\t\tThe Cinema Museum, London &mdash; Site by Antbird</p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"social_links\">\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/pages/London/The-Cinema-Museum/94435861815\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/facebook.jpg\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum on Facebook\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://twitter.com/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/twitter.png\" alt=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\" title=\"Follow The Cinema Museum on Twitter\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<!-- Removed obsolete items ... PC 2/2/18\n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/CinemaMuseum\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/youtube-logo.gif\" alt=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\" title=\"Visit The Cinema Museum's YouTube Channel\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a> \n\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/feed/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Syndicate this site using RSS\">\n\t\t\t<img src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/images/rss.png\" alt=\"Subscribe to the Cinema Museum's RSS Feed\" title=\"Subscribe to the Cinema Museum's RSS Feed\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t</a>-->\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"full_clear very_flat\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Powered by eShop v6.3.14 by Rich Pedley http://www.quirm.net/--><!-- Lightbox Plus v2.0.5 - 2010.07.02 - Message: 0-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\njQuery(document).ready(function($){\n  $(\"a[rel*=lightbox]\").colorbox({opacity:0.8});\n});\n</script>\n<script>\r\n  (function(i,s,o,g,r,a,m){i['GoogleAnalyticsObject']=r;i[r]=i[r]||function(){\r\n  (i[r].q=i[r].q||[]).push(arguments)},i[r].l=1*new Date();a=s.createElement(o),\r\n  m=s.getElementsByTagName(o)[0];a.async=1;a.src=g;m.parentNode.insertBefore(a,m)\r\n  })(window,document,'script','//www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js','ga');\r\n\r\n  ga('create', 'UA-41628024-1', 'cinemamuseum.org.uk');\r\n  ga('send', 'pageview');\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/lightbox-plus/js/jquery.colorbox-min.js?ver=1.3.8\" id=\"lightbox-js\"></script>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
