{ padding: 0 10.8px; }\n                    }\n                </style>\n\t\t<!--[if IE 9]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie9.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div id=\"content_box\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"posts\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<span class=\"previous\">&larr; <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/exploding-cinema-february/\" rel=\"prev\">Exploding Cinema February</a></span>\r\n\t<span class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-never-let-go-1960/\" rel=\"next\">Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>Never Let Go</em> (1960)</a> &rarr;</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"clear whitespace\"></div>\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34693\" class=\"post-34693 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: Comment and Edit functionality removed from following post header. Date reduced to Month and Year. Conditional 'Featured Article' added\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Celebrating Peter Sellers: <em>I’m All Right Jack</em> (1959)</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 8 Mar 2025 @ 19:30 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- by David --> &middot; \r\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-im-all-right-jack-1959/#comments\">No Comments</a> &middot; -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a>\t\t\t\t\t<!--  -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: I'm not clear when the_content pagination would be triggered.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tIf triggered, consider changing to plug-in based pagination.\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-im-all-right-jack-1959/\"></div><p><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"I’m All Right Jack - click to enlarge\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-34695 size-large\" title=\"I’m All Right Jack - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-488x371.jpg\" alt=\"I’m All Right Jack\" width=\"488\" height=\"371\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-488x371.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-300x228.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-768x584.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-150x114.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-90x68.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1-100x75.jpg 100w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-1.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a>Peter Sellers is one of the greatest character actors in the history of British cinema; a name to rank alongside Peter Finch, Alec Guinness and Trevor Howard. To mark the centenary of the year of his birth, The Cinema Museum will commence a seasons of six key Sellers performances.</p>\n<p><em>I’m All Right Jack</em> (1959), the Boulting Brothers satire on British industrial life in the 1950s, features one of Sellers&#8217;s best remembered roles, as Fred Kite, the communist shop steward at the missile factory where Ian Carmichael&#8217;s hapless Stanley Windrush has been sent to spy on the workers.</p>\n<p>Followed by a Q&amp;A discussion with leading film and media experts Dr. Graham McCann, Robert Ross and David Stubbs.</p>\n<p>Dr. Andrew Roberts, the curator of the event says: “Selecting the best of Seller’s work was a genuine challenge. At worst, he could be utterly self-indulgent; at his finest, he could variously induce laughter, fear and pain by his expressions alone”.</p>\n<p>Doors open at 18.30, for a 19.30 start.</p>\n<p><strong>16mm Film Presentation</strong></p>\n<p>Refreshments will be available in our licensed cafe/bar.</p>\n<h3>TICKETS &amp; PRICING</h3>\n<p>Tickets £10.</p>\n<p>Advance tickets may be purchased from <a href=\"https://ticketlab.co.uk/event/id/29285\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ticketlab</a>, or direct from the Museum by calling 020 7840 2200 in office hours.<br />\n<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"I’m All Right Jack - click to enlarge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-34697 size-large\" title=\"I’m All Right Jack - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-488x296.jpg\" alt=\"I’m All Right Jack\" width=\"488\" height=\"296\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-488x296.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-300x182.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-768x466.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-150x91.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2-90x55.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Im-All-Right-Jack-2.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a></p>\n<!-- PHP 5.x --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on the_content --><div class=\"at-below-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2024/celebrating-peter-sellers-im-all-right-jack-1959/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on the_content -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type='text/javascript'>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//<![CDATA[\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.write(\"<h4 class='backLink'>[<a href='javascript:history.back()' class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back<\\/a>]<\\/h4>\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//]]>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</script>\t\t\t\t\t<noscript><h4 class='backLink'>[<a href=\"\" class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back</a>]</h4></noscript>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tagged\"><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/tag/contact/\" rel=\"tag\">Contact</a>&middot;<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/tag/ticketlab/\" rel=\"tag\">TicketLab</a></p>\t\t\t\tRC: Remove tag functionality and replace the 'clear' div with a flatter 'clear flat' one.\r\n-->\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clear flat\"></div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<!--\t\t\r\n\t\t\tRC: Comment functionality removed. (IE8 fails to see this as comment, so commented the php also.)\r\n\t\t\t-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"sidebar\">\r\n\t<ul class=\"sidebar_list\">\r\n\t\t<li id=\"search-3\" class=\"widget widget_search\"><h2 class=\"widgettitle\">Search</h2>\n<form method=\"get\" id=\"search_form\" action=