ie following a young boy who teams up with a photojournalist to look for his lost mother. When a bomb endangers the Pha Tang temple, &#8216;Satu&#8217; an orphan child laborer decides to head north through the [&#8230;]\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/screening-of-satu-year-of-the-rabbit-2024-with-intro-and-qa-2/\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Satu-Poster.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"The Cinema Museum, London\" />\n\t\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/favicon.ico\" />\n\t\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/style.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/custom.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t<![endif]-->\n\t<!--[if lte IE 6]>\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/ie6.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t<![endif]-->\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/themes/Cutline-1-1.4-2ColumnRight/print.css\" />\n\n<meta name='robots' content='max-image-preview:large' />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n/* <![CDATA[ */\nwindow._wpemojiSettings = {\"baseUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/core\\/emoji\\/14.0.0\\/72x72\\/\",\"ext\":\".png\",\"svgUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/core\\/emoji\\/14.0.