media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div id=\"content_box\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"posts\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<span class=\"previous\">&larr; <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-danger-diabolik-1968/\" rel=\"prev\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>Danger: Diabolik</em> (1968)</a></span>\r\n\t<span class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-the-cramps-and-the-mutants-the-napa-state-tapes-1978/\" rel=\"next\">Some new kind of kick presents <em>The Cramps and The Mutants: The Napa State Tapes</em> (1978)</a> &rarr;</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"clear whitespace\"></div>\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-34895\" class=\"post-34895 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: Comment and Edit functionality removed from following post header. Date reduced to Month and Year. Conditional 'Featured Article' added\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Some new kind of kick presents <em>Engaged to Death</em> (1957)</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sat 19 Jul 2025 @ 19:30 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- by David --> &middot; \r\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/#comments\">No Comments</a> &middot; -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a>\t\t\t\t\t<!--  -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: I'm not clear when the_content pagination would be triggered.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tIf triggered, consider changing to plug-in based pagination.\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\"></div><p><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Engaged to Death - click to enlarge\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-34899 size-large\" title=\"Engaged to Death - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1-488x317.jpg\" alt=\"Engaged to Death\" width=\"488\" height=\"317\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1-488x317.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1-300x195.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1-150x98.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1-90x59.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-1.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a><strong>Some new kind of kick &#8211; celluloid rock n roll trash on a Saturday night.</strong></p>\n<p><em>I fidanzati della morte</em>, the best and most exciting film set in the world of motorsport, features Geoff Duke, Enrico Lorenzetti, Libero Liberati, Reg Armstrong and a host of fifties racers.</p>\n<p>Doors open at 18.30, for a 19.30 start.<br />\n<strong><br />\nDigital Presentation.</strong></p>\n<p>Refreshments will be available in our licensed cafe/bar.</p>\n<h3>TICKETS &amp; PRICING</h3>\n<p>Tickets £8.</p>\n<p>Advance tickets may be purchased from <a href=\"https://ticketlab.co.uk/event/id/29804#/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ticketlab</a>, or direct from the Museum by calling 020 7840 2200 in office hours.<br />\n<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Engaged to Death - click to enlarge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-34897 size-large\" title=\"Engaged to Death - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3-488x347.jpg\" alt=\"Engaged to Death\" width=\"488\" height=\"347\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3-488x347.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3-300x214.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3-150x107.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3-90x64.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Engaged-to-death-3.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a></p>\n<!-- PHP 5.x --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on the_content --><div class=\"at-below-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/some-new-kind-of-kick-presents-engaged-to-death-1957/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on the_content -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type='text/javascript'>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//<![CDATA[\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.write(\"<h4 class='backLink'>[<a href='javascript:history.back()' class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back<\\/a>]<\\/h4>\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//]]>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</script>\t\t\t\t\t<noscript><h4 class='backLink'>[<a href=\"\" class='