            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:og=\"http://ogp.me/ns#\" xmlns:fb=\"http://www.facebook.com/2008/fbml\">\n\n<head profile=\"http://gmpg.org/xfn/11\">\n\n\t<!-- Global site tag (gtag.js) - New Google Analytics - Added 2/2/18 by PC - This does not affect Rob's legacy GA call in footer.php -->\n\t<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-113465929-1\"></script>\n\t<script>\n\t\twindow.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n\t\tfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n\t\tgtag('js', new Date());\n\t\tgtag('config', 'UA-113465929-1');\n\t</script>\n\n\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n\n\t<!-- A shop item page or shop search listing page may have a top-level department; if present it should be included the its title. -->\n\t\n\t<!-- Create title and description, allowing for rss output. -->\n\t\t\t\n\t<title>Some new kind of kick presents The Return of the Living Dead (1985) &raquo; The Cinema Museum, London</title>\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Horror and sci-fi screenplay maestro Dan O'Bannon directs this 1985 horror comedy. Two bumbling employees at a medical supply warehouse release a deadly gas into the air, which causes the dead to rise again as zombies.\" />\n\t<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WordPress 6.4.5\" /> <!-- leave this for stats -->\n\t\n\t<!-- Facebook Open Graph -->\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Some new kind of kick presents The Return of the Living Dead (1985) &raquo; The Cinema Museum, London\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Horror and sci-fi screenplay maestro Dan O'Bannon directs this 1985 horror comedy. Two bumbling employees at a medical supply warehouse release a deadly gas into the air, which causes the dead to rise again as zombies.\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" co