n and (-ms-high-contrast: active), (-ms-high-contrast: none) {\n                        /* Like IE9, which support conditional comments, IE10 needs less padding than the IE8 default */\n                        .sf-blue a, .sf-blue a:hover, .sf-blue a:visited { padding: 0 10.8px; }\n                    }\n                </style>\n\t\t<!--[if IE 9]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie9.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\t\t<!--[if IE 7]>\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/plugins/menubar-templates/menubar-ie7.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n\t\t<![endif]-->\n\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div id=\"content_box\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"posts\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\r\n<div class=\"navigation\">\r\n\t<span class=\"previous\">&larr; <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/screening-of-satu-year-of-the-rabbit-2024-with-intro-and-qa-2/\" rel=\"prev\">Screening of <em>Satu &#8211; Year of the Rabbit</em> (2024) with intro and Q&#038;A</a></span>\r\n\t<span class=\"next\"><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/museum-tour-dates-august-2025/\" rel=\"next\">Museum tour dates August 2025</a> &rarr;</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"clear whitespace\"></div>\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-35083\" class=\"post-35083 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-events tag-contact tag-ticketlab\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry_header\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: Comment and Edit functionality removed from following post header. Date reduced to Month and Year. Conditional 'Featured Article' added\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Misty Moon presents <em>Dracula: Dead and Loving It</em> (1995) + Q&#038;A with Lysette Anthony</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sun 26 Oct 2025 @ 14:00 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- by David --> &middot; \r\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/#comments\">No Comments</a> &middot; -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/topics/events/\" rel=\"category tag\">Events</a>\t\t\t\t\t<!--  -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry\">\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t\tRC: I'm not clear when the_content pagination would be triggered.\r\n\t\t\t\t\tIf triggered, consider changing to plug-in based pagination.\r\n-->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"at-above-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\"></div><p><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It - click to enlarge\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-35086 size-large\" title=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2-488x313.jpg\" alt=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It\" width=\"488\" height=\"313\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2-488x313.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2-300x193.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2-150x96.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2-90x58.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-2.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a>Misty Moon presents Mel Brooks&#8217;s horror spoof, starring the great Leslie Nielsen as the Count and Brooks himself as Van Helsing. The screening is followed by a Q&amp;A with star Lysette Anthony, who plays Lucy Westenra (and other guests to be announced).<span id=\"more-35083\"></span></p>\n<p><em>Dracula: Dead and Loving It</em> (1995) is the last film that Mel Brooks has directed, a spoof on the Bram Stoker novel and the various films that have been made of it. Count Dracula relocates from his Transylvanian castle to Victorian London, in search of new blood. Two beautiful young women, Mina and Lucy attract his attention, but when Mina&#8217;s fiancé notices his future bride&#8217;s strange behaviour, he calls in vampire hunter Van Helsing. </p>\n<p>Lysette Anthony has starred in films such as <em>Without a Clue</em> (1988), <em>Husbands and Wives</em> (1992) and <em>Look Who&#8217;s Talking Now</em> (1993). On television, she had leading roles in the BBC sitcom <em>Three Up, Two Down</em>, the Channel 4 soap <em>Hollyoaks</em> and Thames TV police drama series <em>The Bill</em>.</p>\n<p>Doors open at 13.00, for a 14.00 start. The Q&#038;A will start at 16.00. </p>\n<p>Refreshments will be available in our licensed cafe/bar.</p>\n<h3>TICKETS &amp; PRICING</h3>\n<p>Tickets: Film and Q&#038;A £30; film only £10; Q&#038;A only £20.</p>\n<p>Advance tickets may be purchased from <a href=\"https://ticketlab.co.uk/series/id/1897#/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ticketlab</a>, or direct from the Museum by calling 020 7840 2200 in office hours.<br />\n<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It - click to enlarge\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-35084 size-large\" title=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It - click to enlarge\" src=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-488x260.jpg\" alt=\"Dracula: Dead and Loving It\" width=\"488\" height=\"260\" srcset=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-488x260.jpg 488w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-300x160.jpg 300w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-768x409.jpg 768w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-1536x818.jpg 1536w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-150x80.jpg 150w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1-90x48.jpg 90w, http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/dracula-dali-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" /></a></p>\n<!-- PHP 5.x --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings below via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons above via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons below via filter on the_content --><div class=\"at-below-post addthis_tool\" data-url=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/2025/misty-moon-presents-dracula-dead-and-loving-it-1995-qa-with-lysette-anthony/\"></div><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on the_content -->\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type='text/javascript'>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//<![CDATA[\r\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.write(\"<h4 class='backLink'>[<a href='javascript:history.back()' class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back<\\/a>]<\\/h4>\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\t//]]>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</script>\t\t\t\t\t<noscript><h4 class='backLink'>[<a href=\"\" class='backLink' title='Go back'>&larr; Go back</a>]</h4></noscript>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n<!--\r\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tagged\"><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/tag/contact/\" rel=\"tag\">Contact</a>&middot;<a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/tag/ticketlab/\" rel=\"tag\">TicketLab</a></p>\t\t\t\tRC: Remove tag functionality and replace the 'clear' div with a flatter 'clear flat' one.\r\n-->\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\